enture games as just being an  interactive narrative these days  adventure games can be many different  things that can be like the old-school  thing it can be a new thing it could be  a number of different things but do let  us know what kind of adventure games you  guys like to play if indeed you're a fan  of adventure  and what you see the future of adventure  games being Oh tell us why you don't  like adventure games that's that's also  very valid and tell us anything you want  to see us chat about in the PC realm  what's got you interested and we'll be  back with another episode next week so  leave your comments  [Music]
 

